      ],
      "source": "https://www.stjotx.com/"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Saint Jo sits on the historic Chisholm Trail, where millions of cattle once crossed en route to Kansas.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12,
